povarennaya-kniga-name = cookbook
povarennaya-kniga-content = [head=1]Cookbook[/head]
    {"(authors: Prasat Al-Deir Wahid and Goldur the Wise)"}

    {"This book of dishes and meals was compiled by Prasat Al-Deir Wahid and Goldur the Wise, that knowledge might be preserved concerning the preparation of food, the blending of spices, the heat of the hearth, and the gifts of land and sea with which the Most High has endowed mankind."}

    {"Within these pages are set forth the means of preparing dishes known both in the homes of common folk and at the tables of prosperous men. Also described are the ways of obtaining various fruits, grains, herbs, oils, and other ingredients needful to the cook's craft."}

    {"May this work serve all who wish to learn the art of food, so that their meals may be hearty, fragrant, and worthy of a good house."}

    {"[head=3]Chapters: [/head]"}

    {"Ch. 1 - Baking"}

    {"Ch. 2 - Side Dishes"}

    {"Ch. 3 - Main Dishes"}

    {"Ch. 4 - Salads and Appetizers"}

    {"Ch. 5 - Ingredients"}

    {"==============( Chapter 1 - Baking )==============="}

    {"Let us begin with the foundation of every baked dish - dough."}

    {"Dough:"}

    {"- x10u water"}

    {"- x15u flour"}

    {"Cake batter:"}

    {"- x15u flour"}

    {"- x5u sugar"}

    {"- x12u egg (this is 4 eggs)"}

    {"Pie dough:"}

    {"- x15u flour"}

    {"- x5u salt"}

    {"- x12u egg (this is 4 eggs)"}

    {"With a rolling pin, one may roll either a whole portion of dough or a smaller piece, and from this obtain two preparations for various dishes."}

    {"A whole dough becomes a thin, flat base for the dish called \"pizza\" - a meal common in the south of the Empire, of which more shall be said in the second chapter. If this dough is properly cut before baking, it becomes the raw beginning of a croissant, not yet acquainted with the oven's heat. When a small piece of dough is rolled, it becomes a long rope of dough, the base for a bagel."}

    {"To make buns and muffins, the dough must be divided into portions, yet first it should be cut with a knife. One prepared dough yields three pieces fit for the baker's further craft."}

    {"Bread:"}

    {"- x1 dough"}

    {"10 seconds"}

    {"Sausage bread:"}

    {"- x1 dough"}

    {"- x1 raw meat"}

    {"15 seconds"}

    {"Meat bread:"}

    {"- x1 dough"}

    {"- x2 raw cutlet"}

    {"- x2 cheese wedge"}

    {"15 seconds"}

    {"Cream cheese bread:"}

    {"- x1 dough"}

    {"- x2 cheese wedge"}

    {"- x5u milk"}

    {"15 seconds"}

    {"Baguette:"}

    {"- x1 dough"}

    {"- x5u black pepper"}

    {"- x5u salt"}

    {"15 seconds"}

    {"Bun:"}

    {"- x1 dough piece"}

    {"5 seconds"}

    {"I dare warn the reader: muffin tins are rare and difficult to obtain, for their making requires skilled craft, and therefore merchants almost never keep them among their goods."}

    {"Muffin:"}

    {"- x1 dough piece"}

    {"- x1 muffin tin"}

    {"- x10u sugar"}

    {"15 seconds"}

    {"Berry muffin:"}

    {"- x1 dough piece"}

    {"- x1 berries"}

    {"- x1 muffin tin"}

    {"- x10u sugar"}

    {"15 seconds"}

    {"Cherry muffin:"}

    {"- x1 dough piece"}

    {"- x3 cherry"}

    {"- x1 muffin tin"}

    {"- x10u sugar"}

    {"15 seconds"}

    {"Bagel:"}

    {"- x1 dough rope"}

    {"5 seconds"}

    {"Poppy-seed bagel:"}

    {"- x1 dough rope"}

    {"- x1 poppy seeds"}

    {"5 seconds"}

    {"To obtain butter, one must mix milk with salt and bring the mixture to its proper state:"}

    {"- x15u milk"}

    {"- x5u salt"}

    {"Croissant:"}

    {"- x1 butter slice"}

    {"- x1 raw croissant"}

    {"5 seconds"}

    {"Sugar cookie:"}

    {"- x1 butter slice"}

    {"- x5u flour"}

    {"- x10u sugar"}

    {"5 seconds"}

    {"Oatmeal cookie:"}

    {"- x1 butter slice"}

    {"- x5u oats"}

    {"- x5u sugar"}

    {"5 seconds"}

    {"Pancakes:"}

    {"- x6u egg (this is 2 eggs)"}

    {"- x5u flour"}

    {"- x5u milk"}

    {"Blueberry pancakes:"}

    {"- x6u egg (this is 2 eggs)"}

    {"- x5u flour"}

    {"- x5u milk"}

    {"- x1 berries"}

    {"The situation with pie tins is much the same as with muffin tins: buying them from merchants is nearly impossible."}

    {"Cherry pie:"}

    {"- x1 pie dough"}

    {"- x5 cherry"}

    {"- x1 pie tin"}

    {"15 seconds"}

    {"Apple pie:"}

