    {"============( Chapter 2 - Side Dishes )============"}

    {"I have already mentioned \"pizza\", and so the recipes for such dishes shall be set forth first. I warn the reader: nearly every pizza requires many ingredients and takes about half a minute to prepare, yet these labors are justified by unusual taste and worthy presentation."}

    {"Side dishes are foods served together with the main meal. Most often they are food with garnish, or fare not quite as filling as the chief dishes of the table."}

    {"Margherita pizza:"}

    {"- x1 flat dough"}

    {"- x1 cheese wedge"}

    {"- x4 tomato"}

    {"30 seconds"}

    {"Mushroom pizza:"}

    {"- x1 flat dough"}

    {"- x5 chanterelle"}

    {"30 seconds"}

    {"Meat pizza:"}

    {"- x1 flat dough"}

    {"- x1 cheese wedge"}

    {"- x4 raw meat"}

    {"- x1 tomato"}

    {"30 seconds"}

    {"Vegetable pizza:"}

    {"- x1 flat dough"}

    {"- x1 carrot"}

    {"- x1 corn cob"}

    {"- x1 tomato"}

    {"- x1 eggplant"}

    {"30 seconds"}

    {"If the reader wonders how to obtain \"animal proteins\", meat must be ground in an alchemical mortar. The mortar itself may be bought from merchants or found in workshops and storerooms. Remember, if the meat has dried out or stinks of rot, it is no calamity! Grind it boldly; animal fat is still suitable for a number of dishes!"}

    {"Dumplings:"}

    {"- x3 dough piece"}

    {"- x10u water"}

    {"- x6u animal proteins"}

    {"15 seconds"}

    {"Boiled rice:"}

    {"- x1 bowl"}

    {"- x10u rice"}

    {"- x15u water"}

    {"15 seconds"}

    {"Rice with fried egg:"}

    {"- x1 boiled rice"}

    {"- x1 carrot"}

    {"- x6u egg (this is 2 eggs)"}

    {"15 seconds"}

    {"Rice with pork:"}

    {"- x1 boiled rice"}

    {"- x3 raw cutlet"}

    {"15 seconds"}

    {"Oatmeal:"}

    {"- x1 bowl"}

    {"- x15u oats"}

    {"- x10u water"}

    {"15 seconds"}

    {"=============( Chapter 3 - Main Dishes )==========="}

    {"The chief dish of a meal, or first dish, is most often soup - hot, thick, and rich."}

    {"Black-eyed gumbo:"}

    {"- x1 boiled rice"}

    {"- x3 raw cutlet"}

    {"- x2 chili pepper"}

    {"15 seconds"}

    {"Mushroom soup:"}

    {"- x1 bowl"}

    {"- x2 chanterelle"}

    {"- x5u milk"}

    {"- x5u water"}

    {"10 seconds"}

    {"Vegetable soup:"}

    {"- x1 bowl"}

    {"- x1 carrot"}

    {"- x1 eggplant"}

    {"- x1 corn cob"}

    {"- x1 potato"}

    {"- x5u water"}

    {"10 seconds"}

    {"Stew:"}

    {"- x1 bowl"}

    {"- x1 carrot"}

    {"- x1 eggplant"}

    {"- x1 tomato"}

    {"- x1 chanterelle"}

    {"- x1 potato"}

    {"- x3 raw cutlet"}

    {"- x10u water"}

    {"10 seconds"}

    {"Nettle soup:"}

    {"- x1 bowl"}

    {"- x1 potato"}

    {"- x1 nettle"}

    {"- x6u egg (this is 2 eggs)"}

    {"- x10u water"}

    {"10 seconds"}

    {"Bowl of hot chili:"}

    {"- x1 bowl"}

    {"- x1 chili pepper"}

    {"- x1 raw cutlet"}

    {"- x1 onion slice"}

    {"- x1 tomato"}

    {"20 seconds"}

    {"French onion soup:"}

    {"- x1 bowl"}

    {"- x5 onion slice"}

    {"- x1 cheese wedge"}

    {"- x10u water"}

    {"10 seconds"}

    {"Pea soup:"}

